Task 2
  Create a constant variable to store the GST rate (for example, 18%) and use it to calculate the final price of a Zomato order with a given base price.<br><br><em><strong>Constraint:</strong> The GST rate must not be changeable after its initial assignment.</em>
Answer
  #include<stdio.h>
  int main()
  {
  	printf("Welcome to zomatao online food delivery plateform\n");
  	//constant variable decelaration
  	const float gst=0.18;
  	int orderPrice = 500;
  	
  	//print the actual & final price of order
  	printf("Actual price of order : %d\n",orderPrice);
  	printf("Final price of order : %f",(orderPrice+(orderPrice*gst)));
  }


